<title>FRANCE: Socialists say French markets would &quot;adjust&quot;.</title>
<headline>Socialists say French markets would &quot;adjust&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Socialist Party expects that the situation on the financial markets will &quot;adjust&quot; after a drop on Monday on the back of a possible win by left-wing parties in the parliamentary election.</p>
<p>Dominique Strauss-Kahn, co-writer of the party's economic programme, told Reuters: &quot;The markets have already known a situation with the left in power.&quot;</p>
</text>
